，导致进程返回 HTTP 500 状态码并主动退出（Exit Code 2）。\n- **业务层面**：日志 (fact-4) 明确记录了 `http_status: 500` 且伴随着 `runtime process exiting`。\n- **系统层面**：Kubernetes 报告容器以 `Error` 原因终止，退出码为 `2` (fact-2)，且处于 `CrashLoopBackOff` 状态 (fact-1, fact-6)。\n\n**缺失的决定性事实 (证据不足部分)：**\n- 无法确认 `/work` 接口返回 500 的**具体业务原因**（如具体的异常堆栈、未找到的资源、配置错误等），因为未采集 previous logs 或 debug 级别的详细日志。\n- 无法确认是否存在**上游依赖服务故障**，因为未采集依赖服务的 metrics。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 1.5m\n├─ 问题定位: 17.5s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 58.5s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-06/workload-7679bcf76-jwr8b: 58.5s (Evidence 49.2s, RCA 9.1s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 14.8s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-06/workload-7679bcf76-jwr8b**: pod-crashloop-runtime\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 90.806, "metrics": {"run_id": "da269c06b8924ab5", "mttr": {"value": "1.5m", "seconds": 90.81081700325012, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "42%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-crashloop-runtime", "pass": true, "score": 1.0, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.2}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.7, "weighted_score": 0.14, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "部分因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.15, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "核心: pod-crashloop-runtime"}, {"name": "llm